weight: bold; visibility: visible;\">李哲律师</span>。</span></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0; margin: 10px 0px; transform: translate3d(10px, 0px, 0px); box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle; display: inline-block; line-height: 0; width: 81%; height: auto; box-sizing: border-box; visibility: visible;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72LkLJE7ATx6WVdLWQfWEPibv44vwA43etEGWWpEZbibhvqSZZuAZm4Gib2ibu0Uw6KEqDlema3qrP2pqQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=2\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\" style=\"vertical-align: middle; max-width: 100%; width: 548.359px !important; box-sizing: border-box; height: auto !important; visibility: visible !important;\" data-original-style=\"vertical-align: middle;max-width: 100%;width: 100%;box-sizing: border-box;\" data-index=\"5\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72LkLJE7ATx6WVdLWQfWEPibv44vwA43etEGWWpEZbibhvqSZZuAZm4Gib2ibu0Uw6KEqDlema3qrP2pqQ/640?wx_fmt=jpeg&amp;tp=webp&amp;wxfrom=5&amp;wx_lazy=1#imgIndex=2\" _width=\"100%\" alt=\"图片\" data-report-img-idx=\"2\" data-fail=\"0\"></section></section><section style=\"line-height: 0;margin: -70px 0px 10px;text-align: right;transform: translate3d(-21px, 0px, 0px);-webkit-transform: translate3d(-21px, 0px, 0px);-moz-transform: translate3d(-21px, 0px, 0px);-o-transform: translate3d(-21px, 0px, 0px);box-sizing: border-box;\"><section style=\"vertical-align: middle;display: inline-block;line-height: 0;width: 51%;height: auto;border-bottom-right-radius: 23px;overflow: hidden;box-sizing: border-box;\" nodeleaf=\"\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_jpg/jNSvMVkX72LkLJE7ATx6WVdLWQfWEPibvDyQ8nk4CcQgVcwXF3EUN9oGvTohicsf2zSCjtpUVPdn37T2SMqL4MZA/640?wx_fmt=jpeg#imgIndex=3\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img js_img_placeholder wx_img_placeholder\" data-ratio=\"0.6666666666666666\" data-s=\"300,640\" data-w=\"1080\